        "aa0a3893-03d8-4cb3-9bf1-0ac6f00475e4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "section_bg_color": "#06211e",
        "stress_text": "<p>GET BETTER SLEEP, LOWER YOUR STRESS AND CONTROL ANXIETY BY ADDING THIS POWERFUL AYURVEDIC HERB TO YOUR DAILY ROUTINE… AND RELEASE ITS “ADAPTOGENIC SUPERPOWERS”!</p><p>…SHOWN TO BOOST ATHLETIC PERFORMANCE, IMPROVE LIBIDO AND REGULATE IMMUNE FUNCTION!</p>",
        "stress_title": "ORGANIC  KSM-66® ASHWAGANDHA",
        "button_text": "YES I WANT MY  KSM-66 ASHWAGANDHA!",
        "the_image": "shopify://shop_images/Product_img-optimized.png",
        "alignment": "left",
        "img_txt_title": "CLINICALLY PROVEN REDUCTION OF STRESS AND ANXIETY UP TO 70%. RECOVER YOUR MOOD, FEEL MORE ENERGIZED AND HAVE A BETTER SLEEP.",
        "img_txt_text": "Award winning KSM-66 Ashwagandha root extract is naturally harvested in India and produced in the USA, and it comes in easy to swallow plant-based capsules without additives.",
        "tribe_image": "shopify://shop_images/TO_018_SecondayLogoWhite_Transpa_2057172e-9d54-4161-9acf-55bda5fd4710.png",
        "tribe_icon_1": "shopify://shop_images/non-gmo-project.png",
        "icon_text_1": "",
        "tribe_icon_2": "shopify://shop_images/usda-organic.png",
        "icon_text_2": "",
        "tribe_icon_3": "shopify://shop_images/gluten-free_1.png",
        "icon_text_3": "",
        "tribe_icon_4": "shopify://shop_images/star-logo.png",
        "icon_text_4": "Kosher",
        "tribe_icon_5": "shopify://shop_images/3rd-party_63f01075-6fdb-4561-a1f5-bfd230e8d083.png",
        "icon_text_5": "3rd Party Tested",
        "tribe_icon_6": "shopify://shop_images/flag-logo.png",
        "icon_text_6": "Made in the USA",
        "tribe_icon_7": "shopify://shop_images/cgmp-logo.png",
        "icon_text_7": "Good Mfg. Practices",
        "defend_title": "DEFEND AGAINST STRESS AND ANXIETY. INCREASE VITALITY AND FOCUS. SUPPORT IMMUNITY. IMPROVE SLEEP.",
        "defend_button_text": "YES I WANT MY  KSM-66 ASHWAGANDHA!",
        "the_text": "<p>If you’re trudging through life at only half the capacity you think you should, great news is, you’ve found the tonic your body needs…</p><p>The bad news, you’ve been feeling mentally defeated, exhausted by life and battling stress and anxiety all this time!</p><p>But let’s just stop for a moment, because if you’re SO stressed out that…</p>",
        "list_text1": "– It’s causing you to feel anxious all the time.",
        "list_text2": "– You’re not sleeping properly…because you’re wired at night.",
        "list_text3": "– You said goodbye to your libido.",
        "list_text4": "– You’re under-performing during and after exercise.",
        "list_text5": "– Chronic exhaustion is affecting everything else from your metabolism to your gut health, and general mental focus…",
        "rating_text": "“I’ve been taking this stuff every morning for the last two weeks and I got to say, it’s pretty awesome. It really helps with my anxiety and improves my performance in life. I noticed myself in a better mood, less stressed, and a sharper mind prolonged from the morning to the evening.”",
        "author_name": "JEREMY G."
      }
    },
    "6ea22e35-5c8c-4e84-8660-84f6f8451b08": {
      "type": "ksm-transforming-people-section",
      "settings": {
        "section_bg_color": "#faede9",
        "main_title": "THEN YOU’LL BE AMAZED HOW THIS “ANCIENT WONDER HERB” IS LITERALLY TRANSFORMING PEOPLE’S LIVES...",
        "rating_text": "\"I don’t feel anxious anymore, I sleep great every day, I get through the day with energy and I have an extra boost in my workouts. I love it and will continue taking it!!!\"",
        "author_name": "JUDSON T.",
        "the_text1": "<p>Now, while this century has brought with it many conveniences and technological breakthroughs…We’re sicker than ever and more and more of us are crippled by chronic stress, anxiety, sleep issues and vulnerable immune systems.\t</p>",
        "the_title": "THE SCALE OF OUR MENTAL HEALTH CRISIS FEELS IRREPARABLE",
        "the_text2": "<p>Since nearly half of all adults suffer harmful health effects from stress. It’s estimated That around 1 in 4 Americans suffer from a mental disorder…and anxiety disorders are the #1 mental health issue among US adults.</p><p>PLUS… around 75 – 90% of doctor visits are linked to stress-related ailments and complaints.</p><p>In fact, Dr. Varalakshmi Yanamandra (Healthspan) has openly stated that “Chronic stress is linked to many health conditions such as heart disease, diabetes, obesity, weakened immune system, fatigue, burn out and even autoimmune diseases.”</p>",
        "the_image": "shopify://shop_images/girl-image-optimized.png"
      }
    },
    "c210cb35-d24c-44aa-8316-77bceef1b079": {
      "type": "struggle-story-section",
      "settings": {
        "section_bg_color": "#06211e",
        "stuggle_text1": "<p>You see, these days people don’t sleep properly, their intimate relationships are affected, their immune systems have tanked, they gain weight…and more. Maybe that’s been you – or you’re struggling right now, desperate to start turning your life around?</p>",
        "struggle_title": "LIKE YOU, I’VE STRUGGLED…I TOSSED ASIDE LIFE-CHANGING OPPORTUNITIES TOO",
        "stuggle_text2": "<p>Because the truth is, it hasn’t always been easy for me –</p><p>My troubled childhood led to HUGE anxiety battles I struggled with…</p><p>Some of the life-changing opportunities I was given to play soccer, I threw away – my anxiety and self-sabotage caused my behavior to spiral out of control.</p><p>This was a big catalyst that drove where I’m sitting today and provided the motivation behind the Tribe Organics brand, and eventually the development of this game-changing product…</p>",
        "life_jacket_title": "IT’S WHAT I LIKE TO CALL THE “STRESS LIFE JACKET”",
        "left_image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_1-optimized.png",
        "right_image": "shopify://shop_images/ashwa_120_open-optimized.png",
        "the_text": "<p>Ashwagandha is something Ayurvedic practitioners swear by for health, vitality and more for longer than we can really comprehend!</p><p>To manage stress, we’re usually told to be less busy, do breathing, meditation, visit our physician or exercise…</p><p>However, these things rarely work on their own…and there’s a reason why… But first, we’ve noticed that people who typically become stressed or anxious, rush to treat it…</p>"
      }
    },
    "77d40903-5368-4470-bc45-e16b1fd8d9a3": {
      "type": "ancient-herb-section",
      "settings": {
        "section_bg_color": "#06211e",
        "the_title1": "BUT THIS IS THE FIRST MISTAKE...",
        "the_text1": "<p>And that’s because you need to get to the ROOT of the problem – dig deep into understanding why your body is making you feel the way you do.</p><p>Of course, your symptoms – like stress, exhaustion, impacted strength & fitness, or anxiety… are all made worse by an imbalance in your body. Trouble is…</p>",
        "the_title2": "THE WAY YOU’VE BEEN TRYING TO CONTROL YOUR SYMPTOMS, IS ALL WRONG …",
        "the_text2": "<p>You get so caught up in your symptoms, you don’t even know how or where to begin?!</p><p>Truth is, it’s not necessarily the “stress” itself, per se – or the lifestyle, but your body’s way of dealing with or responding to stress.</p><p>I quickly discovered that most anxious people have a higher stress response since their adrenal glands are producing too much “stress hormone”.</p><p>Their body fails to naturally calm or lower this stress hormone to re-balance. However, using adaptogenic herbs, it is not only possible to lower stress and anxiety…</p><p>But they help your body adapt to stress and deal with it in a much healthier, natural way. This means by adapting to the “stress” your nervous system response is functioning normally.</p>",
        "the_title3": "YOU MIGHT BE THINKING...  CAN AN ANCIENT HERB POSSIBLY HELP?",
        "the_text3": "<p>But the research proves this adaptogen absolutely works!</p><p>You’re about to discover benefits like:</p>",
        "list_text1": "– How this 3,000-year-old adaptogen can lower your cortisol , and therefore manage your stress response by adapting to the stressful symptoms…",
        "list_text2": "– Help you to increase your athletic performance (including your recovery)…",
        "list_text3": "– Help improve your sleep quality (no more dreading bedtime)…",
        "list_text4": "– Improve your sexual function and sex hormone regulation …",
        "list_text5": "– Stimulating your thyroid (an inactive thyroid = high-stress hormone release).",
        "the_image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled-3-optimized.png",
        "alignment": "left",
        "img_title": "KSM-66® ASHWAGANDHA",
        "img_sub_title1": "THE 3,000-YEAR-OLD HERB THEY CALL “INDIAN GINSENG”",
        "img_sub_title2": "The Highest Concentration, Highly Bioavailable, Full Spectrum Root Extract"
      }
    },
