    "370a0c7a-660f-41bc-b9bb-bea89c8f3f0f": {
      "type": "custom-journey-section",
      "blocks": {
        "dae4d616-6904-42f1-a104-d420cc00982b": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "I WANT TO SHARE MY JOURNEY WITH YOU…",
            "the_text": "<p>As a youngster, despite being surrounded by music and playing for the youth teams of worldwide recognized soccer teams, Real Madrid and Atletico de Madrid…</p><p>I had a difficult childhood. I was given a lot of love, but I was also abused.</p><p>I was destined to be a soccer player. But the abuse eventually came out as ANXIETY and FEAR by the age of 9. This only got worse!</p><p>By 21 I quit soccer, my dream, my passion. I couldn’t take the anxiety anymore. The pressure. The promises.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d4d35419-1e62-45a0-a754-28c2d7ff0c07": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "the_image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_5_1_-min.png",
            "alignment": "left",
            "img_txt_text": "<p>In my early 20s, an opportunity soon came up in the New York fashion scene…</p><p>I left my hometown (Madrid) headed to the big apple…New York City! Here I worked as a model for nearly 12 years.</p><p>Yet despite the attractiveness of the fashion scene, I knew my path toward inner freedom was not in NYC, so my search continued….</p><p>However, I soon discovered that I was excited about the idea of working remotely…</p><p>Being able to travel, live a healthy life and having freedom over my time while making money.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c5ea7d8c-74fd-42b8-a5f9-7ab041973d5b": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "THIS WAS A TURNING POINT IN MY LIFE...",
            "the_text": ""
          }
        },
        "ad67473b-2c2d-4744-bda9-12e02b4b1dff": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "the_image": "shopify://shop_images/DSCF1414-3-scaled-e1667218682534-optimized.png",
            "alignment": "right",
            "img_txt_text": "<p>The path of travel led me to work with sacred plants and the curiosity in the field began to grow.</p><p>At some point, I had built the strength and determination to take the big step and move out of New York (which meant leaving financial security) to pursue my dream.</p><p>I moved to Guatemala and TRIIBE Organics was created.</p><p>And it was here, I set out to develop all-natural supplements that would help people to feel better, to feel healthier and to take control over the quality of their lives.</p><p>Because prior to my move down to Guatemala, I was fatigued, anxious, stressed and my body was out of balance!</p>"
          }
        },
        "9b13b6ea-55e7-471b-aeae-73370d68c3e7": {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "BACK THEN, NOTHING SEEMED TO WORK FOR ME. SOME REMEDIES FELT LIKE NOTHING MORE THAN TEMPORARY “DEPRESSION TONICS”",
            "the_text": "<p>I tried things including:</p><p>– Reducing caffeine – it can take up to 2 months to completely reset your Adenosine receptors. For around 10 days headaches are severe, low mood, low energy, seeking another “pick-me-up”. The other thing is that people generally enjoy its taste and consider it “social”.</p><p>– Exercising more – yoga is so slow and mindful, it allows you too much time to think – which can make you feel anxious. With running, you can “gas out” and get your heart rate too high…making anxiety even worse before you get to a quarter of a mile!</p><p>– Breathing/breathwork – very healthy for you and helps regulate your mood and your nervous system. Breathing has been shown to activate your parasympathetic nervous system (calming) which is switched on typically as we calm down in the evenings. Problem was forgetting to do this or sticking to a strict routine – that, ironically, became a mini stressor in itself!</p><p>– L-Theanine – this alone may not do much, it could make a good day better, perhaps make you feel more relaxed, but on bad days of anxiety doesn’t add too much improvement.</p><p>– Antidepressant medication – too many side effects, drowsiness and unpleasant “numbness” and mood swings. Prescription meds I’ve heard are addictive and notoriously difficult to come off of.</p><p>– CBD – the issue here is that it either doesn’t have any effect at all…or can leave you feeling “too relaxed and sleepy”</p>"
          }
        },
        "62caf432-d676-4973-9ae3-a58b0ccb9c2f": {
          "type": "testimonial_section",
          "settings": {
            "author_image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_6_1_-min.png",
            "rating_text": "\"I've always had issues sleeping and lacking energy throughout the day. Since I've taken this, I definitely notice the difference. Better sleep, more energy throughout the day, and I'm able to focus better. This stuff is great!\"",
            "author_name": "POLLY RALDA",
            "author_position": "Big Wave Surfer"
          }
        },
        "e065e5a4-0f6c-4425-a525-431f48a9cc57": {
          "type": "heading_text",
          "settings": {
            "the_title": "IT’S WHY REGULAR PEOPLE ACROSS THE WORLD ARE TRYING KSM-66 ASHWAGANDHA!"
          }
        }
