          "type": "product_detail_blocks",
          "settings": {
            "prod_detail_title": "PRODUCT DETAILS",
            "block_title_1": "PURE ORGANIC  <br>ASHWAGANDHA",
            "block_text_1": "KSM-66 Ashwagandha is sustainably harvested without chemicals and is water extracted following “Green Chemistry” principles. It is USDA Organic, EU Organic and Canada Organic.",
            "block_title_2": "FULL SPECTRUM  <br>ROOT EXTRACT",
            "block_text_2": "KSM-66 Ashwagandha Full Spectrum version’s extraction process involves pre-treating the Ashwagandha roots with small quantities of cow milk (BSE-TSE free) in accordance with the traditional Ayurvedic practice. For this reason, this variant contains small remaining quantities of milk constituents. This leads to a full-spectrum extract which maintains the large suite of bio-actives found in the raw root, leading to a higher efficacy.",
            "block_title_3": "PREMIUM  <br>EFFICACY",
            "block_text_3": "The Ashwagandha herb’s efficacy is derived from a complex blend of active constituents called withanolides. They need to be present in their natural proportions. KSM-66 Ashwagandha managed to create a process that overcomes the challenges after many years of research and development, this is why TRIIBE KSM-66 Ashwagandha root extract is standardized to more than 5% Withanolides."
